OL,3,GNEWSAGender-critical equality officer
OL,4,Aunfairly sacked by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn equality and diversity specialist
OL,7,Fwas unfairly sacked by a council after
OL,8,Fa "Kafkaesque" investigation into her
OL,9,Fhaving liked or commented on posts that
OL,10,Fwere critical of transgender ideology,
OL,11,Fa judge has ruled.
OL,13,FLorna Young, who was a manager at
OL,14,FManchester City Council, was dismissed
OL,15,Fafter a staff member found an account
OL,16,Fon social media platform X linked to
OL,17,Fher which had several posts that were
OL,18,Fcritical of transgender ideology and a
OL,19,Fcomment that a non-binary vicar had
OL,20,Fbeen guided by "the devil".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
